    {
      "title": "Update v. 1.26",
      "date": "2024-04-20 01:56:12",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5762994032397051054",
      "content": "New Characters!\n\nNow, on the character selection screen, three new characters are available. Upon choosing one of them, it will be necessary to complete a challenge to unlock their full use in the game. The challenges have a considered level of difficulty. It is not necessary to purchase additional items in the store to complete them.\n\nCosplay: A version of Bikini Girl wearing a heroine costume. Cosplay is a performative art in which practitioners wear costumes to portray a character from pop culture.\nChallenge: Platforming\n\nSuccubus: A version of Chinese Girl. Succubus is a mythological being. A type of creature with a feminine appearance that invades men's dreams in order to steal their life energy.\nChallenge: Platforming\n\nTranshumanist: A version of the Actor. Transhumanists are individuals who use technology to evolve human condition to its maximum potentialities, reaching the level of post-human.\nChallenge: Boss Fight"
    },
